        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnett%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town of Arnett developed at the junction of local trading routes and established its first post office in 1902.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnett%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arnett won a runoff election in June 1908 to become the permanent county seat of Ellis County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
