      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnett%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Ellis County Courthouse in Arnett is recognized on the National Register of Historic Places.",
